    {
      "name": "about_app",
      "value": "Reverb · 余音"
    },
    {
      "name": "about_version",
      "value": "Version 1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "name": "about_h_what",
      "value": "What is this"
    },
    {
      "name": "about_p_what",
      "value": "Reverb is a lightweight podcast client with an ink-and-wash aesthetic. Discover shows, subscribe, download for offline, and resume anytime — focused on listening."
    },
    {
      "name": "about_h_features",
      "value": "Features"
    },
    {
      "name": "about_p_features",
      "value": "· Discover: browse daily charts by region and category; reorder and swipe between categories\n· Search: by name or paste an RSS URL\n· Library: manage Subscriptions, Downloads and History\n· Offline downloads: cache while listening, Wi-Fi-only optional\n· Playback: speed, skip, sleep timer, resume, background & lock-screen controls\n· Show notes: swipe on the player\n· New-episode notifications\n· Appearance: dark/light/system, text size, accent color, multiple languages"
    },
    {
      "name": "about_h_philosophy",
      "value": "Design"
    },
    {
      "name": "about_p_philosophy",
      "value": "Visually it draws on ink, celadon and beam-gold — the name and icon echo “an echo circling the rafters.”\n\nFor sources it stays entirely free, no login, no API key: discovery relies on public sources only, and it always returns to the publisher's own RSS and streams the original audio — copyright-clean, zero cost.\n\nFor privacy, subscriptions, history and downloads live only on your device — never uploaded, never tracked."
    },
    {
      "name": "queue_play_next",
      "value": "Play next"
    },
    {
      "name": "queue_add",
      "value": "Add to queue"
    },
    {
      "name": "mark_played",
      "value": "Mark as played"
    },
    {
      "name": "mark_unplayed",
      "value": "Mark as unplayed"
    },
    {
      "name": "a11y_favorite",
      "value": "Favorite"
    },
    {
      "name": "a11y_unfavorite",
      "value": "Remove from favorites"
    },
    {
      "name": "privacy_consent_title",
      "value": "Privacy policy"
    },
    {
      "name": "privacy_consent_body",
      "value": "Reverb is a fully local podcast client. Before you start, here is how your data is handled.\n\nWe collect no personal information. There is no server, no account, no third-party SDKs, no analytics and no ads.\n\nYour data stays on this device. Subscriptions, history, favorites, downloads, listening time, stamps and settings are stored in the app's private directory and removed on uninstall.\n\nWhat the network is used for. To fetch and play podcasts, your device directly contacts the publishers' own RSS, audio and artwork URLs; when you tap \"Import recommended feeds\", it downloads a subscription list from this app's website. No credentials and no user identifiers are attached; see the full policy for the complete list.\n\nPermissions. Internet, network state (to detect Wi-Fi for \"download on Wi-Fi only\"), background audio playback, and notifications (only when you enable update reminders). No location, contacts, camera, microphone, SMS, call log or calendar access is requested.\n\nTapping \"Agree and continue\" means you have read and accept this policy."
